<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <IncidentDef>
    <defName>DNX_MechanoidDroneSwarm</defName>
    <label>mechanoid reconnaissance</label>
    <workerClass>DNX.IncidentWorker_MechDroneSwarm</workerClass>
    <category>ThreatBig</category>
    <baseChance>1.2</baseChance>
    <earliestDay>20</earliestDay>
    <minRefireDays>12</minRefireDays>
    <pointsScaleable>true</pointsScaleable>
    <minThreatPoints>250</minThreatPoints>
    <targetTags>
      <li>Map_PlayerHome</li>
    </targetTags>
    <tale>Raid</tale>
    <ignoreRecentSelectionWeighting>true</ignoreRecentSelectionWeighting>
    <canOccurOnAllPlanetLayers>true</canOccurOnAllPlanetLayers>
    <requireColonistsPresent>true</requireColonistsPresent>
    <letterDef>ThreatBig</letterDef>
    <letterLabel>Mechanoid reconnaissance</letterLabel>
    <letterText>A squad of mechanoid mantas has arrived above the colony. They will track and attack colonists and turrets. Be careful: they can fly over defenses and walls!</letterText>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="DNX.MechDroneSwarmIncidentExtension">
        <droneDef>DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone</droneDef>
        <droneDefName>DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone</droneDefName>
        <minDrones>3</minDrones>
        <maxDrones>70</maxDrones>
        <pointsPerDrone>80</pointsPerDrone>
        <edgeInset>6</edgeInset>
        <spawnRadius>14</spawnRadius>
        <droneTypes>
          <li>
            <droneDef>DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone</droneDef>
            <droneDefName>DNX_MechanoidAssaultDrone</droneDefName>
            <points>80</points>
            <earliestDay>0</earliestDay>
            <maxCount>70</maxCount>
            <selectionWeight>1</selectionWeight>
          </li>
          <li>
            <droneDef>DNX_MechanoidBombardManta</droneDef>
            <droneDefName>DNX_MechanoidBombardManta</droneDefName>
            <points>220</points>
            <earliestDay>30</earliestDay>
            <maxCount>8</maxCount>
            <selectionWeight>0.35</selectionWeight>
          </li>
        </droneTypes>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </IncidentDef>

  <IncidentDef>
    <defName>DNX_HostileLandwhaleArrival</defName>
    <label>Landwhale arrival</label>
    <workerClass>DNX.IncidentWorker_HostileLandwhale</workerClass>
    <category>ThreatBig</category>
    <baseChance>0</baseChance>
    <hidden>true</hidden>
    <pointsScaleable>false</pointsScaleable>
    <minThreatPoints>1800</minThreatPoints>
    <targetTags>
      <li>Map_PlayerHome</li>
      <li>Map_Misc</li>
    </targetTags>
    <tale>Raid</tale>
    <requireColonistsPresent>true</requireColonistsPresent>
    <letterDef>ThreatBig</letterDef>
    <letterLabel>Landwhale arrival</letterLabel>
    <letterText>An old corporate armed vehicle, an HFSV-40 Landwhale ground-effect fire support vehicle, has appeared near the colony edge. This is not a normal raid target: the Landwhale carries a main cannon, auxiliary weapons, and an onboard point-defense system. Its weapons are mounted as independent modules and can be destroyed separately. If you destroy the main cannon first, the Landwhale's threat will drop sharply. Its point-defense system will try to intercept heavy shells, rockets, and other decisive munitions before they connect. Use cheap, low-quality explosive rounds or other expendable fire to saturate the interceptors, then send in your heavy shots while the defense is distracted or reloading.</letterText>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="DNX.HostileLandwhaleIncidentExtension">
        <landwhaleDef>DNX_Hostile82AHoverVehicle</landwhaleDef>
        <landwhaleDefName>DNX_Hostile82AHoverVehicle</landwhaleDefName>
        <edgeInset>8</edgeInset>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </IncidentDef>

  <IncidentDef>
    <defName>DNX_LandwhaleHuntOfferIncident</defName>
    <label>Hunt the Landwhale</label>
    <workerClass>DNX.IncidentWorker_LandwhaleHuntOffer</workerClass>
    <category>Misc</category>
    <baseChance>0.35</baseChance>
    <earliestDay>30</earliestDay>
    <minRefireDays>45</minRefireDays>
    <pointsScaleable>false</pointsScaleable>
    <targetTags>
      <li>Map_PlayerHome</li>
      <li>Map_Misc</li>
    </targetTags>
    <requireColonistsPresent>true</requireColonistsPresent>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="DNX.LandwhaleHuntIncidentExtension">
        <landwhaleDef>DNX_Hostile82AHoverVehicle</landwhaleDef>
        <landwhaleDefName>DNX_Hostile82AHoverVehicle</landwhaleDefName>
        <edgeInset>8</edgeInset>
        <firstOfferDay>30</firstOfferDay>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </IncidentDef>

</Defs>

